naway cost, and create denial-of-service conditions. Wrap LLM calls with timeouts and implement circuit breaker patterns to cap maximum spend per session.\n"},"help":{"markdown":"LLM API call is made without a timeout context manager or retry limit decorator. Unguarded LLM calls in agent loops can exhaust API budgets, cause runaway cost, and create denial-of-service conditions. Wrap LLM calls with timeouts and implement circuit breaker patterns to cap maximum spend per session.\n","text":"LLM API call is made without a timeout context manager or retry limit decorator. Unguarded LLM calls in agent loops can exhaust API budgets, cause runaway cost, and create denial-of-service conditions. Wrap LLM calls with timeouts and implement circuit breaker patterns to cap maximum spend per session.\n"},"id":"backend.packs.agent-safety.rules.semgrep.ast022-no-llm-circuit-breaker","name":"backend.packs.agent-safety.rules.semgrep.ast022-no-llm-circuit-breaker","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":["LOW CONFIDENCE"]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Semgrep Finding: backend.packs.agent-safety.rules.semgrep.ast022-no-llm-circuit-breaker"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Potential logging of sensitive AI data (prompts/completions/keys)"},"help":{"markdown":"Potential logging of sensitive AI data (prompts/completions/keys)","text":"Potential logging of sensitive AI data (prompts/completions/keys)"},"id":"backend.packs.data-exfil.rules.semgrep.data001-logging-prompts","name":"backend.packs.data-exfil.rules.semgrep.data001-logging-prompts","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":["CWE-532","MEDIUM CONFIDENCE","security"]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Semgrep Finding: backend.packs.data-exfil.rules.semgrep.data001-logging-prompts"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"LLM response flows directly into a database write without PII redaction.\n"},"help":{"markdown":"LLM response flows directly into a database wr